                  "timeZone" : "America/New_York"
               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "MORE NOTES on testing/debugging this code:",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "(probably ignorable)",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : ">>>> LOOK AT RegressionTest22_SycnhonizedUpgradeLock_",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "              FIND WAY TO HOLD ONTO LOCK – BUT OTHERWISE THIS LOOKS GOOD.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Critical to do UPGRADELOCK this weekend – in synchronized – need for HSI – some basic upgradelock.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Like –",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "       Optional<ReadWriteLock> TryUpgradeLock (ReadOnlyLock&)",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "       if (auto oReadWriteLock = syncObj.TryUpgradeLock (&readOnlyLock)) {",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "    here use readwritelock",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "type" : "hardBreak"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : "       }",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "// else { NOTE – readOnlyLock MAY or MAY NOT be locked – forcing lock might create deadlock  in complex case – or at least would translate UpgradeLock to sync instead of try",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "And ASSERT ERROR if you try to create write lock with existing read lock on this thread. MAYBE also assert error if you get write ??? think out other cases to disabllow (or if we can automatically handle – accommodate limits of builtin STL shared lcok)",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "(NOTE – TO DO THAT TESTING – MUST HAVE PLAIN MUTEX AND MULTISET<THREADID> LOCKER, AND ADD / REMOVE THREADS TO THAT MUTLSET ON SUCCESSFUL LOCKS/UNLOCKS – ALL OF WHICH I MUST MONITOR AND GO THROUGH ME – SO I CAN MONOTOR. Then can assert/cehjck safe use.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "----",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "       Syncrhonized<> use unique_lock and shared_lock more neatly, - can probably lose LOCK_SHARED/LOCK stuff in TRAITS – and in traits have name of SHARED locker (shared_lock<M>) and excusvieLocker uniquie_lock<MUTEX>).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
